abstract: >-
  A Lean-centered formal research artifact separating canonical historical responsibility from state-indexed current qualification, extending the distinction across environments and change, and recording evidence-gated higher-order research questions. Papers 1–3 and Strict Technical Level 6 are frozen; QX and QC remain pre-formal and do not currently authorize new Lean modules.
